\">채용하고</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 윤명조420; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 윤명조420; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 윤명조420\">소프트웨어 관련 </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; tab-stops: left blank 314.9pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">스타트업 기업의 창업을 지원하기 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 윤명조420\">위해 열리는 이번 대회는</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 윤명조420\"><span>&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 윤명조420\">대학</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 윤명조420; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 윤명조420; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 윤명조420\">원</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 윤명조420; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 윤명조420; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 윤명조420\">생 및 스타트업 기업 등 </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; tab-stops: left blank 314.9pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">일반인 누구나 참여할 수 있습니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 윤명조420; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 윤명조420; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 윤명조420\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.5pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 윤명조420\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">최종 발표 평가를 통하여 선정된 </span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: -0.5pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 윤명조420\">대상에게는 최대 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 윤명조420; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: -0.5pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 윤명조420; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">5</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: -0.5pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 윤명조420\">백만원을 수여</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LETTER-SPACING: -0.5pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 윤명조420\">하며</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 윤명조420; LETTER-SPACING: -0.4pt\"> </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -0.2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">최우수상 및 우수상은 최대 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 윤명조420; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 윤명조420; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">300</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 윤명조420\">만원 및 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 윤명조420; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 윤명조420; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">200</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 윤명조420\">만원</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 윤명조420; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 윤명조420; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, <span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 윤명조420\">장려상에게는 최대 </span>